From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IvyCZE <me@ivy.yt>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:02:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Embermine: 0002-about-screen

Replace the About header text with the Embermine main line and link, show the Embermine version line followed by GeckoView, Application Services and Android Components versions, point What's new and Support at the Embermine GitHub pages, point Privacy notice at PRIVACY.md and remove Know your rights.

